Pattern is fully consistent. All these framework-* links refer to "planned framework cards" that were never produced; the produced artifact is the agent-spec tool card itself. For lines like "**直接来源**：[[framework-yitang-X]] — ..." the semantic intent is "the framework this agent operationalizes". Since the framework card never landed and the agent-spec IS the knowledge carrier, 改链 → the agent-spec card would be self-referential in some cases (e.g. ability-migration-diagnosis linking to itself). Self-links are useless.

  Better adjudication for framework-* phantom planned cards: **断链保文**（去掉 [[]]，文字保留）+ 理由「计划框架卡 07-15 至今未产，无等价活卡；保留文字不误导」。For tool-yitang-* where exact agent-spec counterpart exists → **改链** to tool-agent-spec-yitang-*.

  Wait, but for tool-yitang-scenario-walkthrough etc., the references are cross-references between DIFFERENT agent-spec cards (e.g. aesthetic-radar card references tool-yitang-scenario-walkthrough as 联动工具). 改链 to tool-agent-spec-yitang-scenario-walkthrough is genuinely useful.

